---
fmContentType: glossaryEntry
term: "ScrOG (Screen of Green)"
letter: "S"
anchor: "scrog"
category: "growing"
---

A plant training technique in which a horizontal screen or net is placed above cannabis plants, and branches are woven through the screen as they grow to create a flat, even canopy. ScrOG maximises light exposure across all bud sites and can significantly increase yield in limited space. More involved than LST but well-suited to indoor growing where light footprint is fixed.
